Appears to be a [[poetic]] use of the {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|呉音|tr=goon}} reading, in reference to a rank of {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|端女郎||tr=hashi jorō|low-end prostitute}} in the Kansai region. According to a popular song, a {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|月||tr=gachi|moon}} prostitute cost one {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|匁|tr=monme|pos=old unit of [[currency]], worth roughly 3.75 [[gram]]s of [[silver]]}}, a {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|影||tr=kage|shadow}} prostitute cost two ''monme'', and a {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|汐||tr=shio|[[tide]]; [[loveliness]]}} prostitute cost three ''monme''.<ref name="DJR"/><ref name="KDJ">{{R:Kokugo Dai Jiten}}</ref>

